Z||000007||Haze_Performance||03-12-2001||06:41 PM||||UPDATE!!!<P>Well I called them back. (This time when they were open  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> lol ) A woman answered the phone. She said she dosnt check the email (including email orders) untill the end of the day.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> She said "Ill call you tommorow to let you know if we received your order"...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">...<P>THAT SUCKS!!! I ordered them Thur. & now its Mon. & Im still not going to know (Maybe) Tue... Why did I even call them?? I dont think I will be dealing with them again..   <P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttttttt.gif">  </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>PFF Members Photo Page</A><BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1431213" TARGET=_blank><BR>Photopoint Gallery (Updated Weekly)</A>||||reg||8
