Z||000009||Fformula88||03-12-2001||11:45 PM||||They seem to have become overwhelmed by the amount of work that needs to be put into the whole thing.  They are snail slow with everything, and have been having a lot of trouble getting out their magazines.  I know this isn't necessarily a good excuse, considering they are serving paying members.  They do seem to get everything straightened out in the end, but I don't do much business with them anymore.  I find the Fiero Store, Twin Lakes and Kick Hill Farms much easier to deal with for my Fiero needs!||||reg||1
